---
source: crates/rdra-ish-core/src/lifecycle/explore/symmetry/snapshot.rs
expression: text
---
The group rules and reasons, per cone (docs/design/instance-symmetry.md, the per-rule gate).
A line: entity[slots], then G (G_T on a reduced cone): moves or stays, scan=<the scan rules>, G_T=<the reasons>; then, on a reduced cone, H on the sub-lifecycle: the same, H=<the reasons>.
Flags read: --instance-count, --int-range-max, --instances, --max-states. S runs plainly up to 2000000 states (or --max-states) with no memory limit, and past them up to H, as under --symmetry always at the memory limit. The models build with Scope::ALL, a superset of the cones of an --entity line.
Entity lines that name each rule or reason:
  AbsentOwner: 0: fires in no cone
  IdAgainstLiteral: 0: fires in no cone
  JointTooLarge: 0: fires in no cone
  MixedIds: 0: fires in no cone
  Observed:input: 25
  Observed:named by T: 27 (kept without a witness of its own)
  Observed:named by an input: 2 (kept without a witness of its own)
  Observed:named by obs: 19 (kept without a witness of its own)
  Observed:obs: 88
  Observed:stub: 6 (kept without a witness of its own)
  OrderedId: 0: fires in no cone
  OwnerChoice: 0: fires in no cone
  OwnerLiteral: 0: fires in no cone
  PinnedStart: 0: fires in no cone
  Reduced:S: 283
  Reduced:S action param: 288 (kept without a witness of its own)
  Reduced:S var: 283 (kept without a witness of its own)
  Reduced:bit key: 20 (kept without a witness of its own)
  Reduced:input: 10 (kept without a witness of its own)
  Reduced:named by S: 88 (kept without a witness of its own)
  Reduced:named by an input: 2 (kept without a witness of its own)
  UnlinkedCreate: 0: fires in no cone

